    },
    {
      "id": "C03",
      "subject": "Conditional221644 and escaping",
      "disposition": "Static I192 model only: nested terms218360 plus structure/approvals3284. Mandatory real caps and encoding/escaping assumptions remain unverified; neither raw368348 nor margin40500 is actual size, infeasibility or resource evidence."
